All tests pass. Here's a summary of the changes:

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector.go`** — added `Len()` method after `WithStack`:

```go
// Len returns the number of AST nodes the inspector holds,
// the same count ast.Inspect visits over the files given to New.
func (in *Inspector) Len() int {
	n := 0
	for i := range in.events {
		if in.events[i].index > int32(i) {
			n++
		}
	}
	return n
}
```

It counts **push events** in the event list. Push events are identified by `ev.index > i` (their `index` field points forward to the corresponding pop event), while pop events point backward to their push.

**`go/ast/inspector/inspector_test.go`** — extended `TestInspectAllNodes` to verify `Len()` matches both `ast.Inspect`'s visit count and the `Nodes` traversal count.

